From: CanalQb <qrodrigob@gmail.com>
Date: Wed, 12 Aug 2026 17:51:25 -0300
Subject: [PATCH 23/31] =?UTF-8?q?fix:=20connect=20keyhunter=E2=86=92discov?=
 =?UTF-8?q?er=20+=20Node=2022=20+=20cleanup?=
MIME-Version: 1.0
Content-Type: text/plain; charset=UTF-8
Content-Transfer-Encoding: 8bit

[sync GitHub: always]
- Fix MCPDiscovery: read-only scanKeyhunterRegistry (no longer zeroes registry)
- Separate registryFile (mcps/registry.json) vs keyhunterRegistryFile
- Workflow: Node 20 → 22 (deprecation fix)
- Add cleanup CI step: rm node_modules/dist/logs
- meumcp discover now shows 30 MCPs (10 approved free)
- Cleanup local logs post-run
- README: add install guide + MCP install tool
---
 .github/workflows/mcp-keyhunter.yml    |  15 +-
 README.md                              |  78 +++
 knowledge/canonical/mcp_discoveries.md |  26 +-
 knowledge/generated/mcp_registry.json  | 331 +++++------
 mcps/registry.json                     | 783 ++++++++++++++++++++++++-
 package-lock.json                      |   2 +-
 package.json                           |   2 +-
 src/cli.ts                             |   4 +
 src/config/index.ts                    |   1 +
 src/discovery/mcp-discovery.ts         |  43 +-
 src/server.ts                          |   1 +
 11 files changed, 1092 insertions(+), 194 deletions(-)

diff --git a/.github/workflows/mcp-keyhunter.yml b/.github/workflows/mcp-keyhunter.yml
index 5991fe6..8a97db3 100644
--- a/.github/workflows/mcp-keyhunter.yml
+++ b/.github/workflows/mcp-keyhunter.yml
@@ -11,7 +11,6 @@ on:
         description: "Override GitHub search query"
         required: false
         default: ""
-  workflow_call:
 
 permissions:
   contents: write
@@ -22,10 +21,10 @@ jobs:
     steps:
       - uses: actions/checkout@v4
 
-      - name: Use Node.js
+      - name: Setup Node.js 22
         uses: actions/setup-node@v4
         with:
-          node-version: 20
+          node-version: 22
           cache: npm
 
       - name: Build keyhunter
@@ -54,5 +53,13 @@ jobs:
             - Knowledge canonical + README.md auto-updated"
             git push
           else
-            echo "Nenhuma mudança detectada."
+            echo "Nenhuma mudanca detectada."
           fi
+
+      - name: Cleanup CI artifacts + logs
+        if: always()
+        run: |
+          rm -rf node_modules scripts/mcp_keyhunter/node_modules
+          rm -rf scripts/mcp_keyhunter/dist
+          rm -f scripts/mcp_keyhunter/*.log logs/*.log
+          echo "=== Cleanup complete: node_modules + dist + logs removidos ==="
